From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan <ryan@esterlines.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:24:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Reduce the User-Agent in Standard and Strict

Every site gets one Chrome-153 reduced UA per OS. Off keeps Ladybird's
default. A spoofed LoaderConfig.user_agent wins. navigator.userAgent,
appVersion, platform, fetch, and WebSocket handshakes go through the
same helper. No per-site randomness.
